fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s11","report_id":"dev_014","text":"As shown in Figure 2, CNN reaches 62.0% validation accuracy on SVHN.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s12","report_id":"dev_014","text":"Figure 3 shows the accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s13","report_id":"dev_014","text":"EfficientNet reaches 55.0% accuracy on Fashion-MNIST (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s14","report_id":"dev_014","text":"On CIFAR-10, Baseline obtains a accuracy of 78.0% (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s15","report_id":"dev_014","text":"Figure 4 shows the test accuracy by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s16","report_id":"dev_014","text":"As shown in Figure 4, BERT-base outperforms Transformer by 15.6 percentage points on MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s17","report_id":"dev_014","text":"Baseline achieves 70.3% test accuracy on SST-2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s18","report_id":"dev_014","text":"On SVHN, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 52.6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_014_s19","report_id":"dev_014","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}